OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrianisation plans for West
OL,4,AEnd delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme to make "the heart of central
OL,7,FLondon" traffic-free has been delayed.
OL,9,FWestminster City Council and the Crown
OL,10,FEstate's planned scheme would make
OL,11,FRegent Street St James's - the road
OL,12,Fdirectly to the south of Piccadilly
OL,13,FCircus, running to St James's Park -
OL,14,Ftraffic free and enlarge the pedestrian
OL,15,Fspace at Piccadilly Circus.
OL,17,FThe council was due to make a final
OL,18,Fdecision on the scheme in autumn, but
OL,19,Fit has introduced another public
OL,20,Fconsultation for 2027.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
