OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrianisation plans for West
OL,4,AEnd delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the council and
OL,7,FCrown Estate said this was because
OL,8,F"previous rounds of consultation had
OL,9,Fhighlighted areas where more work was
OL,10,Fneeded".
